"""Dashboard generated by the integration.

One sidebar entry ("Health"; German: "Gesundheit") with up to three views per
person: medication, body (weight, waist, BMI, ...) and manage. A view is
visible only to the person's Home Assistant user and to administrators. The
content is built on every load from the current medications and tracked
measurements, so it never needs to be edited by hand. Entities are looked up
by unique id, so renames and the language do not matter.
"""

